Labor Rights
Scope & Core Inquiries: What are working conditions, compensation, and safety standards like for non-executive, frontline, production, warehouse, and service workers? Does the company respect workers' legal right to organize and collectively bargain, or does it deploy anti-union tactics, captive-audience sessions, retaliatory terminations, and union-busting consulting firms? Does it pay a living wage, provide health benefits, paid sick leave, and stable scheduling? Does it misclassify permanent workers as independent contractors or gig workers to deny legal benefits? How humane are production quotas, workplace surveillance, and shift requirements?